{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function injectKeyHold(key): Signal<boolean>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/angular-hotkeys/src/injectKeyHold.ts#L40","children":[{"type":"text","value":"injectKeyHold.ts:40"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Angular inject-based API that returns a signal that is true when the given key is held."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Subscribes to the global KeyStateTracker and uses a computed to determine\nif the specified key is held."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"key","children":[{"type":"text","value":"key"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IndividualKey"},{"type":"text","value":" | (() => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IndividualKey"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The key to check (e.g. 'Shift', 'Control', 'Space') - can be a getter function"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Signal"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Signal that returns true if the key is currently held down"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"@Component({\n  template: `{{ isShiftHeld() ? 'Shift is pressed!' : 'Press Shift' }}`,\n})\nexport class ShiftIndicatorComponent {\n  isShiftHeld = injectKeyHold('Shift')\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"code","value":"@Component({\n  template: `\n    <span [style.opacity]=\"ctrl() ? 1 : 0.3\">Ctrl</span>\n    <span [style.opacity]=\"shift() ? 1 : 0.3\">Shift</span>\n  `,\n})\nexport class ModifierIndicatorsComponent {\n  ctrl = injectKeyHold('Control')\n  shift = injectKeyHold('Shift')\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"key","text":"key","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction injectKeyHold(key): Signal<boolean>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [injectKeyHold.ts:40](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/angular-hotkeys/src/injectKeyHold.ts#L40)\n\nAngular inject-based API that returns a signal that is true when the given key is held.\n\nSubscribes to the global KeyStateTracker and uses a computed to determine\nif the specified key is held.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### key\n\n`IndividualKey` \\| (() => `IndividualKey`)\n\nThe key to check (e.g. 'Shift', 'Control', 'Space') - can be a getter function\n\n## Returns\n\n`Signal`\\<`boolean`\\>\n\nSignal that returns true if the key is currently held down\n\n## Examples\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  template: `{{ isShiftHeld() ? 'Shift is pressed!' : 'Press Shift' }}`,\n})\nexport class ShiftIndicatorComponent {\n  isShiftHeld = injectKeyHold('Shift')\n}\n```\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  template: `\n    <span [style.opacity]=\"ctrl() ? 1 : 0.3\">Ctrl</span>\n    <span [style.opacity]=\"shift() ? 1 : 0.3\">Shift</span>\n  `,\n})\nexport class ModifierIndicatorsComponent {\n  ctrl = injectKeyHold('Control')\n  shift = injectKeyHold('Shift')\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: injectKeyHold\ntitle: injectKeyHold\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction injectKeyHold(key): Signal<boolean>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [injectKeyHold.ts:40](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/angular-hotkeys/src/injectKeyHold.ts#L40)\n\nAngular inject-based API that returns a signal that is true when the given key is held.\n\nSubscribes to the global KeyStateTracker and uses a computed to determine\nif the specified key is held.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### key\n\n`IndividualKey` \\| (() => `IndividualKey`)\n\nThe key to check (e.g. 'Shift', 'Control', 'Space') - can be a getter function\n\n## Returns\n\n`Signal`\\<`boolean`\\>\n\nSignal that returns true if the key is currently held down\n\n## Examples\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  template: `{{ isShiftHeld() ? 'Shift is pressed!' : 'Press Shift' }}`,\n})\nexport class ShiftIndicatorComponent {\n  isShiftHeld = injectKeyHold('Shift')\n}\n```\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  template: `\n    <span [style.opacity]=\"ctrl() ? 1 : 0.3\">Ctrl</span>\n    <span [style.opacity]=\"shift() ? 1 : 0.3\">Shift</span>\n  `,\n})\nexport class ModifierIndicatorsComponent {\n  ctrl = injectKeyHold('Control')\n  shift = injectKeyHold('Shift')\n}\n```\n"}
